### T01 - Brak tokenu: GET reservations (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations

### T02 - USER: lista własnych rezerwacji (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### T03 - ADMIN: lista wszystkich rezerwacji (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### T04 - USER: próba filtrowania po userId (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?userId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### T05 - ADMIN: filtrowanie po userId (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?userId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### T06 - USER: pobranie własnej rezerwacji (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{ownReservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### T07 - USER: pobranie cudzej rezerwacji (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{otherReservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### T08 - ADMIN: pobranie cudzej rezerwacji (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{otherReservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### T09 - USER: anulowanie własnej rezerwacji (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{ownReservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### T10 - USER: anulowanie cudzej rezerwacji (404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{otherReservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### T11 - ADMIN: pobranie budynków (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### T12 - USER: pobranie budynków (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### T13 - USER: utworzenie budynku (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test building",
  "address": "Test address"
}

### T14 - USER: aktualizacja budynku (403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/buildings/{{buildingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test building updated"
}

### T15 - USER: usunięcie budynku (403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/buildings/{{buildingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

